    - rid: 1000
      type: {class: BtRoot, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
      data:
        _guid: 28af69cd64d0477dac45aafa128ea0b5
        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A pack hunter (wolf, raptor, hunter-killer drone — any faction): only hunts in a group. Cut off, it slinks back to its kin first. The pack''s lead (the Assault role) holds the target''s attention head-on, circling at 5–8 m; the rest (Flank) fan out to its sides; whoever ends up behind it pounces when it turns. On its own it stalks, rushes and hides (Stalk Rush Hide).'
        _children:
        - 614d578e921b4bb6a7a582f9555170c1
    - rid: 1001
      type: {class: Selector, ns: CGD.BehaviorTrees, asm: CGD.Runtime}
